/* ASK 378 rev 3 (DoD 2, W1 8040, W3 8036, W4 8048): every verdict or RESULT change, in STEP order, not text position. Rank 1: the cure (a v21 with no send-back marker that is not v25's twin); rank 2: v25 RECOMPUTED AFTER CURE (its twin v21 folded in); rank 3: v37 SEND-BACK APPLIED (its twin v21, "send-back changes ... applied", folded in). A tag that changes neither verdict nor RESULT is not printed. */
